{"date":"2025-09-17","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_b5bc69ecf2c7830a9b44db66e291ab17","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1758101400,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-09-14","chunk":0,"id":"m_0c05e236cef35743a6de8140e94167f7"}}},{"id":"m_4ce1675050057af1b6b8319d66fd2fc5","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1758101437,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7fd118343eee597724a518390081fc57","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1758101474,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e11f3ab90d611b329e497f003edbde47","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1758101511,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0755e65ab55629dd4a97a9aa6b37903e","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1758101548,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b8c44859d46378e80ca376b720a2e02c","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1758101585,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f1804738643163291a9a8d32ff0146a7","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1758101622,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_e68462424dcc45737c9c8bac53a1136d","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1758101659,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_12eac3fb7e11e5efcd3028d6a0dae9f1","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1758101696,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_02c3727a7d7f67928d041f1b97f8bab9","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1758101733,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_39673df4cc43e5be7ca84f24ae81302d","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1758101770,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_5c977995c1cb125795541935ea7acccc","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1758101807,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4f22d77597de2b9a391e658c114ae94b","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1758101844,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8aae7d0020f7c85c855d3ab024dd2f80","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1758101881,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ba4149e7d275c9791ae8a05f068552a3","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1758101918,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_bb3d29e3822969a7041eb7d88a477dae","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1758101955,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_d1bc2e5d4deb5b24249696a1e7bf11aa","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1758101992,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5de05bde12c7949a7efc8efdfbaec73a","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1758102029,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0d723be279e71bc07f95337696475b50","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1758102066,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_613c8845f82ebef92eedb1b9de208f06","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1758102103,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ceb3c8f8943c6724a1371a58f4232b74","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1758102140,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_685c5a7592e11f3c59ee7b9aa1a40b1c","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1758102177,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9f71c9fbd97cdceeb671bb84a7b5bd2a","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1758102214,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fd00206c7e009c0c14cc271b9871c3e0","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1758102251,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
